ray-900 [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 text-left align-middle whitespace-nowrap last:text-right [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]">Type</th><th data-slot="table-head" class="h-(--ds-size-medium) border-gray-400 px-2 font-medium text-gray-900 [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 text-left align-middle whitespace-nowrap last:text-right [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]">Required</th><th data-slot="table-head" class="h-(--ds-size-medium) border-gray-400 px-2 font-medium text-gray-900 [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 text-left align-middle whitespace-nowrap last:text-right [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]">Description</th></tr></thead><tbody aria-hidden="true" class="h-3 block"></tbody><tbody data-slot="table-body" class="[&amp;_td:first-child]:rounded-l-md [&amp;_td:last-child]:rounded-r-md"><tr data-slot="table-row" class="transition-colors"><td data-slot="table-cell" class="px-2 py-2.5 [&amp;:has([data-cell-link=true])]:p-0 [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 align-middle whitespace-nowrap last:text-right [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]"><code class="text-copy-13-mono text-gray-1000">model</code></td><td data-slot="table-cell" class="px-2 py-2.5 [&amp;:has([data-cell-link=true])]:p-0 [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 align-middle whitespace-nowrap last:text-right [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]"><code class="text-copy-13-mono whitespace-nowrap text-gray-900">string</code></td><td data-slot="table-cell" class="px-2 py-2.5 [&amp;:has([data-cell-link=true])]:p-0 [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 align-middle whitespace-nowrap last:text-right [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px] text-gray-900">Yes</td><td data-slot="table-cell" class="px-2 py-2.5 [&amp;:has([data-cell-link=true])]:p-0 [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 align-middle last:text-right [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px] min-w-[20rem] whitespace-normal text-gray-900">Model ID in the form <code class="text-copy-13-mono rounded bg-gray-100 px-1 py-0.5 text-gray-1000">creator/model</code>, e.g. <code class="text-copy-13-mono rounded bg-gray-100 px-1 py-0.5 text-gray-1000">google/gemini-3.8-flash</code>. AI Gateway routes the request to an available provider.</td></tr><tr data-slot="table-row" class="transition-colors"><td data-slot="table-cell" class="px-2 py-2.5 [&amp;:has([data-cell-link=true])]:p-0 [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 align-middle whitespace-nowrap last:text-right [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]"><code class="text-copy-13-mono text-gray-1000">maxOutputTokens</code></td><td data-slot="table-cell" class="px-2 py-2.5 [&amp;:has([data-cell-link=true])]:p-0 [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 align-middle whitespace-nowrap last:text-right [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]"><code class="text-copy-13-mono whitespace-nowrap text-gray-900">number</code></td><td data-slot="table-cell" class="px-2 py-2.5 [&amp;:has([data-cell-link=true])]:p-0 [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 align-middle whitespace-nowrap last:text-right [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px] text-gray-900">No</td><td data-slot="table-cell" class="px-2 py-2.5 [&amp;:has([data-cell-link=true])]:p-0 [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 align-middle last:text-right [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px] min-w-[20rem] whitespace-normal text-gray-900">Hard cap on generated tokens. Gemini 3.8 Flash supports up to <code class="text-copy-13-mono rounded bg-gray-100 px-1 py-0.5 text-gray-1000">65,535</code> output tokens. Reasoning tokens count toward this limit.</td></tr><tr data-slot="table-row" class="transition-colors"><td data-slot="table-cell" class="px-2 py-2.5 [&amp;:has([data-cell-link=true])]:p-0 [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 align-middle whitespace-nowrap last:text-right [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]"><code class="text-copy-13-mono text-gray-1000">reasoning</code></td><td data-slot="table-cell" class="px-2 py-2.5 [&amp;:has([data-cell-link=true])]:p-0 [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 align-middle whitespace-nowrap last:text-right [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]"><code class="text-copy-13-mono whitespace-nowrap text-gray-900">&#x27;provider-default&#x27; | &#x27;none&#x27; | &#x27;minimal&#x27; | &#x27;low&#x27; | &#x27;medium&#x27; | &#x27;high&#x27; | &#x27;xhigh&#x27;</code></td><td data-slot="table-cell" class="px-2 py-2.5 [&amp;:has([data-cell-link=true])]:p-0 [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 align-middle whitespace-nowrap last:text-right [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px] text-gray-900">No</td><td data-slot="table-cell" class="px-2 py-2.5 [&amp;:has([data-cell-link=true])]:p-0 [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 align-middle last:text-right [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px] min-w-[20rem] whitespace-normal text-gray-900">Provider-agnostic reasoning effort, available in AI SDK 7 or later. Maps to the provider’s native reasoning configuration; reasoning settings under <code class="text-copy-13-mono rounded bg-gray-100 px-1 py-0.5 text-gray-1000">providerOptions</code> take precedence when both are set. See the Reasoning section below.</td></tr><tr data-slot="table-row" class="transition-colors"><td data-slot="table-cell" class="px-2 py-2.5 [&amp;:has([data-cell-link=true])]:p-0 [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 align-middle whitespace-nowrap last:text-right [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]"><code class="text-copy-13-mono text-gray-1000">providerOptions</code></td><td data-slot="table-cell" class="px-2 py-2.5 [&amp;:has([data-cell-link=true])]:p-0 [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 align-middle whitespace-nowrap last:text-right [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]"><code class="text-copy-13-mono whitespace-nowrap text-gray-900">Record&lt;string, JSONValue&gt;</code></td><td data-slot="table-cell" class="px-2 py-2.5 [&amp;:has([data-cell-link=true])]:p-0 [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 align-middle whitespace-nowrap last:text-right [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px] text-gray-900">No</td><td data-slot="table-cell" class="px-2 py-2.5 [&amp;:has([data-cell-link=true])]:p-0 [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 align-middle last:text-right [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px] min-w-[20rem] whitespace-normal text-gray-900">AI Gateway routing options under <code class="text-copy-13-mono rounded bg-gray-100 px-1 py-0.5 text-gray-1000">gateway</code>, plus any provider-native options under the provider’s own namespace — see the table below.</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-4"><h2 class="text-heading-20 font-medium text-gray-1000">Input limits</h2><div data-slot="table-root" class="relative w-full overflow-x-auto"><table data-slot="table" class="text-sm text-gray-900 w-full caption-bottom"><thead data-slot="table-header" class="[&amp;_tr]:border-gray-400 [&amp;_tr]:border-b"><tr data-slot="table-row" class="transition-colors"><th data-slot="table-head" class="h-(--ds-size-medium) border-gray-400 px-2 font-medium text-gray-900 [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 text-left align-middle whitespace-nowrap last:text-right [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]">Input</th><th data-slot="table-head" class="h-(--ds-size-medium) border-gray-400 px-2 font-medium text-gray-900 [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 text-left align-middle whitespace-nowrap last:text-right [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]">Formats</th><th data-slot="table-head" class="h-(--ds-size-medium) border-gray-400 px-2 font-medium text-gray-900 [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 text-left align-middle whitespace-nowrap last:text-right [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]">Sources</th><th data-slot="table-head" class="h-(--ds-size-medium) border-gray-400 px-2 font-medium text-gray-900 [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 text-left align-middle whitespace-nowrap last:text-right [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]">Max count</th><th data-slot="table-head" class="h-(--ds-size-medium) border-gray-400 px-2 font-medium text-gray-900 [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 text-left align-middle whitespace-nowrap last:text-right [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]">Max size</th><th data-slot="table-head" class="h-(--ds-size-medium) border-gray-400 px-2 font-medium text-gray-900 [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 text-left align-middle whitespace-nowrap last:text-right [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]">Limits</th></tr></thead><tbody aria-hidden="true" class="h-3 block"></tbody><tbody data-slot="table-body" class="[&amp;_td:first-child]:rounded-l-md [&amp;_td:last-child]:rounded-r-md"><tr data-slot="table-row" class="transition-colors"><td data-slot="table-cell" class="px-2 py-2.5 [&amp;:has([data-cell-link=true])]:p-0 [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 align-middle whitespace-nowrap last:text-right [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px] text-gray-1000">Text</td><td data-slot="table-cell" class="px-2 py-2.5 [&amp;:has([data-cell-link=true])]:p-0 [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 align-middle whitespace-nowrap last:text-right [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px] text-gray-900">—</td><td data-slot="table-cell" class="px-2 py-2.5 [&amp;:has([data-cell-link=true])]:p-0 [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 align-middle whitespace-nowrap last:text-right [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px] text-gray-900">—</td><td data-slot="table-cell" class="px-2 py-2.5 [&amp;:has([data-cell-link=true])]:p-0 [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 align-middle whitespace-nowrap last:text-right [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px] text-gray-900">—</td><td data-slot="table-cell" class="px-2 py-2.5 [&amp;:has([data-cell-link=true])]:p-0 [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 align-middle last:text-right [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px] whitespace-nowrap text-gray-900">—</td><td data-slot="table-cell" class="px-2 py-2.5 [&amp;:has([data-cell-link=true])]:p-0 [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 align-middle whitespace-nowrap last:text-right [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px] text-gray-900">Prompt and response share the 1M-token context window</td></tr><tr data-slot="table-row" class="transition-colors"><td data-slot="table-cell" class="px-2 py-2.5 [&amp;:has([data-cell-link=true])]:p-0 [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 align-middle whitespace-nowrap last:text-right [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px] text-gray-1000">Image</td><td data-slot="table-cell" class="px-2 py-2.5 [&amp;:has([data-cell-link=true])]:p-0 [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 align-middle whitespace-nowrap last:text-right [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px] text-gray-900">—</td><td data-slot="table-cell" class="px-2 py-2.5 [&amp;:has([data-cell-link=true])]:p-0 [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 align-middle whitespace-nowrap last:text-right [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px] text-gray-900">URL, base64, Uint8Array</td><td data-slot="table-cell" class="px-2 py-2.5 [&amp;:has([data-cell-link=true])]:p-0 [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 align-middle whitespace-nowrap last:text-right [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px] text-gray-900">—</td><td data-slot="table-cell" class="px-2 py-2.5 [&amp;:has([data-cell-link=true])]:p-0 [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 align-middle last:text-right [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px] whitespace-nowrap text-gray-900">—</td><td data-slot="table-cell" class="px-2 py-2.5 [&amp;:has([data-cell-link=true])]:p-0 [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 align-middle whitespace-nowrap last:text-right [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px] text-gray-900">Sent as image parts in messages; counts as input tokens</td></tr><tr data-slot="table-row" class="transition-colors"><td data-slot="table-cell" class="px-2 py-2.5 [&amp;:has([data-cell-link=true])]:p-0 [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 align-middle whitespace-nowrap last:text-right [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px] text-gray-1000">PDF</td><td data-slot="table-cell" class="px-2 py-2.5 [&amp;:has([data-cell-link=true])]:p-0 [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 align-middle whitespace-nowrap last:text-right [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px] text-gray-900">—</td><td data-slot="table-cell" class="px-2 py-2.5 [&amp;:has([data-cell-link=true])]:p-0 [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 align-middle whitespace-nowrap last:text-right [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px] text-gray-900">URL, base64, Uint8Array</td><td data-slot="table-cell" class="px-2 py-2.5 [&amp;:has([data-cell-link=true])]:p-0 [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 align-middle whitespace-nowrap last:text-right [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px] text-gray-900">—</td><td data-slot="table-cell" class="px-2 py-2.5 [&amp;:has([data-cell-link=true])]:p-0 [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 align-middle last:text-right [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px] whitespace-nowrap text-gray-900">—</td><td data-slot="table-cell" class="px-2 py-2.5 [&amp;:has([data-cell-link=true])]:p-0 [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 align-middle whitespace-nowrap last:text-right [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px] text-gray-900">Sent as file parts in messages; counts as input tokens</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-6"><h2 class="text-heading-20 font-medium text-gray-1000">Provider options</h2><p class="text-copy-14 max-w-3xl text-gray-900">Set AI Gateway routing options under <code class="text-copy-13-mono rounded bg-gray-100 px-1 py-0.5 text-gray-1000">providerOptions.gateway</code>. For provider-specific options, pass them under the provider’s namespace as documented by the AI SDK.</p><p class="text-copy-14 max-w-3xl text-gray-900">Learn more in the<!-- --> <a href="https://ai-sdk.dev/providers/ai-sdk-providers/google" rel="noopener" target="_blank" data-zone="null" class="cursor-pointer focus-visible:outline-2 outline-[var(--ds-focus-color)] outline-offset-4 text-gray-1000 underline underline-offset-2">AI SDK google provider docs</a>.</p><div aria-label="Provider options" class="my-4 rounded-lg 