<span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token string">&#x27;vertex&#x27;</span><span class="token punctuation">]</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span><span class="token plain"></span></div></div><div class="line" data-geist-code-block-line="true" id="C6f0cc2d5-L11" style="font-feature-settings:&quot;liga&quot; off"><button aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" type="button" aria-label="Add line anchor to the URL" class="vF3MAa_lineNumber">11</button><div class="token-line"><span class="token plain">      </span><span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span><span class="token plain"></span></div></div><div class="line" data-geist-code-block-line="true" id="C6f0cc2d5-L12" style="font-feature-settings:&quot;liga&quot; off"><button aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" type="button" aria-label="Add line anchor to the URL" class="vF3MAa_lineNumber">12</button><div class="token-line"><span class="token plain">    </span><span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">,</span><span class="token plain"></span></div></div><div class="line" data-geist-code-block-line="true" id="C6f0cc2d5-L13" style="font-feature-settings:&quot;liga&quot; off"><button aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" type="button" aria-label="Add line anchor to the URL" class="vF3MAa_lineNumber">13</button><div class="token-line"><span class="token plain">  </span><span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span><span class="token plain"></span></div></div><div class="line" data-geist-code-block-line="true" id="C6f0cc2d5-L14" style="font-feature-settings:&quot;liga&quot; off"><button aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" type="button" aria-label="Add line anchor to the URL" class="vF3MAa_lineNumber">14</button><div class="token-line"><span class="token plain" style="display:inline-block">
</span></div></div><div class="line" data-geist-code-block-line="true" id="C6f0cc2d5-L15" style="font-feature-settings:&quot;liga&quot; off"><button aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" type="button" aria-label="Add line anchor to the URL" class="vF3MAa_lineNumber">15</button><div class="token-line"><span class="token plain">  </span><span class="token builtin">console</span><span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">log</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token plain">result</span><span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token plain">text</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span><span class="token plain"></span></div></div><div class="line" data-geist-code-block-line="true" id="C6f0cc2d5-L16" style="font-feature-settings:&quot;liga&quot; off"><button aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" type="button" aria-label="Add line anchor to the URL" class="vF3MAa_lineNumber">16</button><div class="token-line"><span class="token plain"></span><span class="token punctuation">}</span><span class="token plain"></span></div></div><div class="line" data-geist-code-block-line="true" id="C6f0cc2d5-L17" style="font-feature-settings:&quot;liga&quot; off"><button aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" type="button" aria-label="Add line anchor to the URL" class="vF3MAa_lineNumber">17</button><div class="token-line"><span class="token plain" style="display:inline-block">
</span></div></div><div class="line" data-geist-code-block-line="true" id="C6f0cc2d5-L18" style="font-feature-settings:&quot;liga&quot; off"><button aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" type="button" aria-label="Add line anchor to the URL" class="vF3MAa_lineNumber">18</button><div class="token-line"><span class="token plain"></span><span class="token function">main</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token function">catch</span><span class="token punctuation">(</span><span class="token builtin">console</span><span class="token punctuation">.</span><span class="token plain">error</span><span class="token punctuation">)</span><span class="token punctuation">;</span></div></div></code></pre></div></div><p class="text-copy-14 max-w-3xl text-gray-900">These AI Gateway routing options apply to every model. Provider-specific options pass through under the provider’s own namespace (for example <code class="text-copy-13-mono rounded bg-gray-100 px-1 py-0.5 text-gray-1000">providerOptions.anthropic</code>) exactly as documented by the AI SDK.</p><div data-slot="table-root" class="relative w-full overflow-x-auto"><table data-slot="table" class="text-sm text-gray-900 w-full caption-bottom"><thead data-slot="table-header" class="[&amp;_tr]:border-gray-400 [&amp;_tr]:border-b"><tr data-slot="table-row" class="transition-colors"><th data-slot="table-head" class="h-(--ds-size-medium) border-gray-400 px-2 font-medium text-gray-900 [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 text-left align-middle whitespace-nowrap last:text-right [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]">Parameter</th><th data-slot="table-head" class="h-(--ds-size-medium) border-gray-400 px-2 font-medium text-gray-900 [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 text-left align-middle whitespace-nowrap last:text-right [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]">Type</th><th data-slot="table-head" class="h-(--ds-size-medium) border-gray-400 px-2 font-medium text-gray-900 [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 text-left align-middle whitespace-nowrap last:text-right [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]">Required</th><th data-slot="table-head" class="h-(--ds-size-medium) border-gray-400 px-2 font-medium text-gray-900 [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 text-left align-middle whitespace-nowrap last:text-right [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]">Description</th></tr></thead><tbody aria-hidden="true" class="h-3 block"></tbody><tbody data-slot="table-body" class="[&amp;_td:first-child]:rounded-l-md [&amp;_td:last-child]:rounded-r-md"><tr data-slot="table-row" class="transition-colors"><td data-slot="table-cell" class="px-2 py-2.5 [&amp;:has([data-cell-link=true])]:p-0 [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 align-middle whitespace-nowrap last:text-right [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]"><code class="text-copy-13-mono text-gray-1000">providerOptions.gateway.only</code></td><td data-slot="table-cell" class="px-2 py-2.5 [&amp;:has([data-cell-link=true])]:p-0 [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 align-middle whitespace-nowrap last:text-right [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]"><code class="text-copy-13-mono whitespace-nowrap text-gray-900">string[]</code></td><td data-slot="table-cell" class="px-2 py-2.5 [&amp;:has([data-cell-link=true])]:p-0 [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 align-middle whitespace-nowrap last:text-right [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px] text-gray-900">No</td><td data-slot="table-cell" class="px-2 py-2.5 [&amp;:has([data-cell-link=true])]:p-0 [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 align-middle last:text-right [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px] min-w-[20rem] whitespace-normal text-gray-900">Restrict routing to these provider slugs. Requests fail over only within the listed providers.</td></tr><tr data-slot="table-row" class="transition-colors"><td data-slot="table-cell" class="px-2 py-2.5 [&amp;:has([data-cell-link=true])]:p-0 [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 align-middle whitespace-nowrap last:text-right [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]"><code class="text-copy-13-mono text-gray-1000">providerOptions.gateway.order</code></td><td data-slot="table-cell" class="px-2 py-2.5 [&amp;:has([data-cell-link=true])]:p-0 [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 align-middle whitespace-nowrap last:text-right [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]"><code class="text-copy-13-mono whitespace-nowrap text-gray-900">string[]</code></td><td data-slot="table-cell" class="px-2 py-2.5 [&amp;:has([data-cell-link=true])]:p-0 [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 align-middle whitespace-nowrap last:text-right [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px] text-gray-900">No</td><td data-slot="table-cell" class="px-2 py-2.5 [&amp;:has([data-cell-link=true])]:p-0 [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 align-middle last:text-right [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px] min-w-[20rem] whitespace-normal text-gray-900">Preferred provider order. Listed providers are tried first; unlisted providers remain available as fallbacks.</td></tr><tr data-slot="table-row" class="transition-colors"><td data-slot="table-cell" class="px-2 py-2.5 [&amp;:has([data-cell-link=true])]:p-0 [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 align-middle whitespace-nowrap last:text-right [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]"><code class="text-copy-13-mono text-gray-1000">providerOptions.gateway.sort</code></td><td data-slot="table-cell" class="px-2 py-2.5 [&amp;:has([data-cell-link=true])]:p-0 [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 align-middle whitespace-nowrap last:text-right [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]"><code class="text-copy-13-mono whitespace-nowrap text-gray-900">&#x27;cost&#x27; | &#x27;ttft&#x27; | &#x27;tps&#x27;</code></td><td data-slot="table-cell" class="px-2 py-2.5 [&amp;:has([data-cell-link=true])]:p-0 [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 align-middle whitespace-nowrap last:text-right [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px] text-gray-900">No</td><td data-slot="table-cell" class="px-2 py-2.5 [&amp;:has([data-cell-link=true])]:p-0 [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 align-middle last:text-right [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px] min-w-[20rem] whitespace-normal text-gray-900">Rank candidate providers by price, time to first token, or tokens per second instead of the default routing order.</td></tr><tr data-slot="table-row" class="transition-colors"><td data-slot="table-cell" class="px-2 py-2.5 [&amp;:has([data-cell-link=true])]:p-0 [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 align-middle whitespace-nowrap last:text-right [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]"><code class="text-copy-13-mono text-gray-1000">providerOptions.gateway.zeroDataRetention</code></td><td data-slot="table-cell" class="px-2 py-2.5 [&amp;:has([data-cell-link=true])]:p-0 [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 align-middle whitespace-nowrap last:text-right [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px]"><code class="text-copy-13-mono whitespace-nowrap text-gray-900">boolean</code></td><td data-slot="table-cell" class="px-2 py-2.5 [&amp;:has([data-cell-link=true])]:p-0 [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 align-middle whitespace-nowrap last:text-right [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px] text-gray-900">No</td><td data-slot="table-cell" class="px-2 py-2.5 [&amp;:has([data-cell-link=true])]:p-0 [&amp;:has([role=checkbox])]:pr-0 align-middle last:text-right [&amp;&gt;[role=checkbox]]:translate-y-[2px] min-w-[20rem] whitespace-normal text-gray-900">Route only to providers with a zero-data-retention policy for this model.</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-6"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><h3 class="text-heading-16 font-medium text-gray-1000">Routing across providers</h3><p class="text-copy-14 max-w-3xl text-gray-900">AI Gateway serves the same model through multiple providers and fails over automatically. <code class="text-copy-13-mono rounded bg-gray-100 px-1 py-0.5 text-gray-1000">order</code> expresses a preference while keeping every provider eligible; <code class="text-copy-13-mono rounded bg-gray-100 px-1 py-0.5 text-gray-1000">only</code> is a hard allowlist — if none of the listed providers are available the request fails instead of falling back.</p><p class="text-copy-14 max-w-3xl text-gray-900">Options under a provider&#x27;s own namespace (for example <code class="text-copy-13-mono rounded bg-gray-100 px-1 py-0.5 text-gray-1000">providerOptions.anthropic</code>) are forwarded to that provider with the request. Providers ignore option namespaces that don&#x27;t apply to them, so it is safe to set provider options alongside <code class="text-copy-13-mono rounded bg-gray-100 px-1 py-0.5 text-gray-1000">gateway</code> routing options.</p></div></div></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-10"><div class="flex flex-col gap-4"><h2 class="text-heading-20 font-medium text-gray-1000">Reasoning</h2><p class="text-copy-14 max-w-3xl text-gray-900">AI Gateway bridges reasoning across every API format. The AI SDK exposes a provider-agnostic top-level <code class="text-copy-13-mono rounded bg-gray-100 px-1 py-0.5 text-gray-1000">reasoning</code> level (<code class="text-copy-13-mono rounded bg-gray-100 px-1 py-0.5 text-gray-1000">none</code>, <code class="text-copy-13-mono rounded bg-gray-100 px-1 py-0.5 text-gray-1000">minimal</code>, <code class="text-copy-13-mono rounded bg-gray-100 px-1 py-0.5 text-gray-1000">low</code>, <code class="text-copy-13-mono rounded bg-gray-100 px-1 py-0.5 text-gray-1000">medium</code>, <code class="text-copy-13-mono rounded bg-gray-100 px-1 py-0.5 text-gray-1000">high</code>, or <code class="text-copy-13-mono rounded bg-gray-100 px-1 py-0.5 text-gray-1000">xhigh</code>); the Chat Completions and Responses formats take the same effort under <code class="text-copy-13-mono rounded bg-gray-100 px-1 py-0.5 text-gray-1000">reasoning.effort</code>; and the Anthropic Messages format uses a native <code class="text-copy-13-mono rounded bg-gray-100 px-1 py-0.5 text-gray-1000">thinking</code> token budget. Whichever you send, the gateway maps it to the target model’s native configuration, converting between effort levels and token budgets as needed. Reasoning-related settings under <code class="text-copy-13-mono rounded bg-gray-100 px-1 py-0.5 text-gray-1000">providerOptions</code> take full precedence over the top-level <code class="text-copy-13-mono rounded bg-gray-100 px-1 py-0.5 text-gray-1000">reasoning</code> value and are never merged. Reasoning tokens typically count toward your output-token usage, though how they’re reported and billed varies by provider.</p><p class="text-copy-14 max-w-3xl text-gray-900">Learn more in the<!-- --> <a href="/docs/ai-gateway/models-and-providers/reasoning" data-zone="667155" class="cursor-pointer focus-visible:outline-2 outline-[var(--ds-focus-color)] outline-offset-4 text-gray-1000 underline underline-offset-2">AI Gateway reasoning guide</a>.</p><div class="flex w-full flex-col"><div aria-orientation="horizontal" class="group no-scrollbar flex flex-nowrap items-center pb-px overflow-x-auto has-[:focus-visible]:overflow-visible gap-6 shadow-[0_-1px_0_var(--accents-2)_inset]" data-geist-tabs="" data-variant="primary" data-version="v1" role="tablist" aria-label="Reasoning"><button aria-selected="true" class="cursor-pointer outline-0 flex items-center bg-transparent -mb-px py-3.5 px-0.5 text-gray-900 border-0 border-b-2 border-transparent text-sm aria-selected:text-gray-1000 group-data-[variant=primary]:aria-selected:border-b-2 group-data-[variant=primary]:aria-selected:border-gray-1000 focus-visible:data-[show-focus-ring=true]:shadow-[var(--ds-focus-ring)] not-disabled:hover:text-gray-1000 disabled:cursor-not-allowed group-data-[variant=secondary]:border-b-0 group-data-[variant=secondary]:h-8 group-data-[variant=secondary]:px-3 group-data-[variant=secondary]:py-0 group-data-[variant=secondary]:rounded-md group-data-[variant=secondary]:text-label-13 group-data-[variant=secondary]: